  "description": "A charming, wealthy college student seems like the perfect boyfriend to a handsome salesman who treats relationships as disposable. But after a sudden breakup, the salesman awakens bound in an unfamiliar place, held captive by the lover he thought he knew. Behind that sweet smile lies a chilling obsession, and now he must face a twisted relationship where leaving is no longer an option.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302044876)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498026920)",
